sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant R as Redis
    participant BE as Backend Service

    C->>LB: GET /api/resource<br/>Header: X-API-Key: pk_live_abc
    LB->>GW: forward request
    GW->>GW: resolve rule for api_key<br/>(plan: pro → 1000 req/min)
    GW->>RL: checkLimit(key=pk_live_abc, rule=pro)
    RL->>R: EVAL lua_script<br/>INCR rate:pk_live_abc:bucket
    R-->>RL: count=42, allowed=true
    RL-->>GW: {allowed: true, remaining: 958, reset_at: 1717524000}
    GW->>BE: forward request
    BE-->>GW: 200 OK + body
    GW-->>C: 200 OK<br/>X-RateLimit-Limit: 1000<br/>X-RateLimit-Remaining: 958<br/>X-RateLimit-Reset: 1717524000
